msgid "# Fine-Grained Tensor Parallelism (Fine-grained TP)"
msgstr "# 细粒度张量并行"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"This capability supports heterogeneous parallelism strategies within a "
"single model, providing finer control over weight distribution, memory "
"layout, and communication patterns across devices. The feature is compatible"
" with standard dense transformer architectures and integrates seamlessly "
"into vLLM’s serving pipeline."
msgstr ""
"此功能支持在单个模型内采用异构并行策略，从而对跨设备的权重分布、内存布局和通信模式提供更精细的控制。该特性与标准稠密 Transformer "
"架构兼容，并能无缝集成到 vLLM 的服务流程中。"

msgid "## Supported Scenarios"
msgstr "## 支持场景"

msgid "### Models"
msgstr "### 模型"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP is **model-agnostic** and supports all standard dense "
"transformer architectures, including Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek (base/dense "
"variants), and others."
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 是**模型无关的**，支持所有标准稠密 Transformer 架构，包括 Llama、Qwen、DeepSeek（基础/稠密变体）等。"

msgid "### Component & Execution Mode Support"
msgstr "### 组件与执行模式支持"

msgid "### Configuration Limit"
msgstr "### 配置限制"

msgid "The Fine-Grained TP size for any component must:"
msgstr "任何组件的细粒度 TP 大小必须满足："

msgid ""
"- Be **≤ the data-parallel (DP) size**, and  \n"
"- **Evenly divide the DP size** (i.e., `dp_size % tp_size == 0`) to ensure valid device assignment and communication grouping."
msgstr ""
"- **≤ 数据并行 (DP) 大小**，并且  \n"
"- **能整除 DP 大小**（即 `dp_size % tp_size == 0`），以确保有效的设备分配和通信分组。"

msgid ""
"> ⚠️ Violating these constraints will result in runtime errors or undefined "
"behavior."
msgstr "> ⚠️ 违反这些约束将导致运行时错误或未定义行为。"

msgid "## How to Use Fine-grained TP"
msgstr "## 如何使用细粒度 TP"

msgid "### Configuration Format"
msgstr "### 配置格式"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP is controlled via the `finegrained_tp_config` field inside "
"`--additional-config`."
msgstr "细粒度 TP 通过 `--additional-config` 中的 `finegrained_tp_config` 字段进行控制。"

msgid "### Example Usage"
msgstr "### 使用示例"

msgid "## Experimental Results"
msgstr "## 实验结果"

msgid ""
"- We achieved significant gains in terms of high memory capacity on a single"
" card, as well as the benefits of TPOT."
msgstr "- 我们在单卡高内存容量以及 TPOT 收益方面取得了显著成果。"

msgid "## ✅ Deployment Recommendations"
msgstr "## ✅ 部署建议"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP is the **most effective** in the **decode instance** of PD "
"separation, where models are typically deployed in all-DP mode. In this "
"setup, sharding weight-heavy layers reduces redundant storage and memory "
"pressure."
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 在 PD 分离的 **decode 实例**中**最为有效**，因为模型通常以全 DP "
"模式部署。在此设置下，对权重较大的层进行分片可以减少冗余存储和内存压力。"

msgid "## Benefits of Fine-grained TP"
msgstr "## 细粒度张量并行的优势"

msgid ""
"Fine-Grained Tensor Parallelism delivers two primary performance advantages "
"through targeted weight sharding:"
msgstr "细粒度张量并行通过针对性的权重分片带来两大性能优势："

msgid ""
"Together, these effects allow practitioners to better balance memory, "
"communication, and compute—particularly in high-concurrency serving "
"scenarios—while maintaining compatibility with standard dense transformer "
"models."
msgstr ""
"综合来看，这些效果使实践者能够更好地平衡内存、通信与计算——尤其是在高并发服务场景中——同时保持与标准稠密Transformer模型的兼容性。"

msgid "| TP config     | Eager | Graph | Hybrid | Prefill | Decode |"
msgstr "| TP 配置       | 即时模式 | 图模式 | 混合模式 | 预填充 | 解码 |"

msgid "| Module           | Memory Savings | TPOT Impact (batch=24)    |"
msgstr "| 模块             | 内存节省 | TPOT 影响（批次=24）    |"

msgid "| o_proj TP = 8    | 5.8 GB         | **+1.5 ms** (degradation) |"
msgstr "| o_proj TP = 8    | 5.8 GB         | **+1.5 毫秒**（性能下降） |"

msgid "| LM head TP = 8   | 1.51 GB        | **−1.2 ms** (improvement) |"
msgstr "| LM head TP = 8   | 1.51 GB        | **−1.2 毫秒**（性能提升） |"

msgid "|  FFN TP = 8 | 0.9 GB         | **−1.0 ms** (improvement) |"
msgstr "|  FFN TP = 8 | 0.9 GB         | **−1.0 毫秒**（性能提升） |"

msgid "| Embedding TP = 8 | 1.51 GB        | **−1.0 ms** (improvement) |"
msgstr "| Embedding TP = 8 | 1.51 GB        | **−1.0 毫秒**（性能提升） |"

msgid "| **Total**        | **9.72 GB**    | —                         |"
msgstr "| **总计**        | **9.72 GB**    | —                         |"

msgid ""
"Fine-Grained Tensor Parallelism (Fine-grained TP) extends standard tensor "
"parallelism by enabling **independent tensor-parallel sizes for different "
"model components**. Instead of applying a single global "
"`tensor_parallel_size` to all layers, Fine-grained TP allows users to "
"configure separate TP sizes for key modules—such as embedding, LM head, "
"attention output projection (o_proj), and MLP blocks—via the "
"`finegrained_tp_config` parameter."
msgstr ""
"细粒度张量并行（Fine-grained TP）通过为不同模型组件启用**独立的张量并行大小**，扩展了标准张量并行。与对所有层应用单一的全局 "
"`tensor_parallel_size` 不同，细粒度 TP 允许用户通过 `finegrained_tp_config` "
"参数为关键模块（如嵌入层、LM 头、注意力输出投影（o_proj）和 MLP 块）配置独立的 TP 大小。"

msgid ""
"- **Reduced Per-Device Memory Footprint**:  \n"
"  Fine-grained TP shards large weight matrices (e.g., LM head, o_proj) across devices, lowering peak memory usage and enabling larger batches or deployment on memory-limited hardware—without quantization."
msgstr ""
"- **降低每设备内存占用**：  \n"
"  细粒度 TP 将大型权重矩阵（如 LM 头、o_proj）分片到多个设备上，从而降低峰值内存使用，并支持在内存受限的硬件上部署更大的批次——无需量化。"

msgid ""
"- **Faster Memory Access in GEMMs**:  \n"
"  In decode-heavy workloads, GEMM performance is often memory-bound. Weight sharding reduces per-device weight fetch volume, cutting DRAM traffic and improving bandwidth efficiency—especially for latency-sensitive layers like LM head and o_proj."
msgstr ""
"- **GEMM 中更快的内存访问**：  \n"
"  在解码密集型工作负载中，GEMM 性能通常受内存限制。权重分片减少了每设备权重获取量，降低了 DRAM 流量并提高了带宽效率——尤其对于 LM 头和 o_proj 等延迟敏感层。"

msgid ""
"> ⚠️ Note:  \n"
">\n"
"> - `o_proj` TP is only supported in Graph mode during Decode, because dummy_run in eager mode will not trigger o_proj. It additionally requires `tensor_parallel_size == 1` (enforced at config load); see [Standard Tensor Parallelism Requirement](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement) below.\n"
"> - `mlp` TP supports dense models, or dense layers in MoE models. For example, the first three dense layers of DeepSeek-R1."
msgstr ""
"> ⚠️ 注意：  \n"
">\n"
"> - `o_proj` TP 仅在 Decode 阶段的 Graph 模式下受支持，因为 eager 模式下的 dummy_run 不会触发 o_proj。此外，它要求 `tensor_parallel_size == 1`（在配置加载时强制执行）；请参阅下面的 [标准张量并行要求](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement)。\n"
"> - `mlp` TP 支持稠密模型，或 MoE 模型中的稠密层。例如，DeepSeek-R1 的前三个稠密层。"

msgid "### Standard Tensor Parallelism Requirement"
msgstr "### 标准张量并行要求"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP shards the configured layer **across the data-parallel (DP) "
"dimension**, not the standard tensor-parallel (TP) dimension. Its interplay "
"with the standard `tensor_parallel_size` therefore differs per component:"
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 将配置的层**沿数据并行（DP）维度**进行分片，而非标准的张量并行（TP）维度。因此，它与标准 "
"`tensor_parallel_size` 的交互因组件而异："

msgid "| Component | Behavior with `tensor_parallel_size > 1` |"
msgstr "| 组件 | 在 `tensor_parallel_size > 1` 时的行为 |"

msgid ""
"| `o_proj` | **Not supported.** The DSA attention output is reshaped with "
"`n_local_groups = n_groups // tp_size` (standard TP), while the wo_a/wo_b "
"weights are sharded by the OTP group (DP dimension). The two axes no longer "
"align, so a config-time error is raised requiring `tensor_parallel_size == "
"1`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `o_proj` | **不支持。** DSA 注意力输出使用 `n_local_groups = n_groups // tp_size`（标准 "
"TP）进行重塑，而 wo_a/wo_b 权重由 OTP 组（DP 维度）分片。这两个轴不再对齐，因此在配置时会引发错误，要求 "
"`tensor_parallel_size == 1`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `embedding` / LM head / `mlp` | **Supported, but only effective under "
"`tensor_parallel_size == 1`.** All three components are sharded along the "
"fine-grained (DP-realm) group, whose process group is built along the DP "
"axis at a fixed `tp_idx` — orthogonal to the standard TP axis. When "
"`tensor_parallel_size > 1`, the standard TP sharding and the fine-grained "
"sharding operate on different axes of the rank grid and can no longer "
"compose: the fine-grained group's ranks all share the same standard-TP "
"weight shard, so fine-grained TP cannot deliver additional sharding. In "
"other words, these components are designed for the all-DP "
"(`tensor_parallel_size == 1`) decode scenario; under `tensor_parallel_size >"
" 1` the standard TP dimension takes over and the fine-grained configuration "
"does not take effect. |"
msgstr ""
"| `embedding` / LM 头 / `mlp` | **支持，但仅在 `tensor_parallel_size == 1` 时有效。** "
"这三个组件都沿细粒度（DP 域）组进行分片，其进程组沿 DP 轴在固定的 `tp_idx` 处构建——与标准 TP 轴正交。当 "
"`tensor_parallel_size > 1` 时，标准 TP 分片和细粒度分片在 rank 网格的不同轴上操作，无法再组合：细粒度组的 rank"
" 都共享相同的标准 TP 权重分片，因此细粒度 TP 无法提供额外的分片。换句话说，这些组件是为全 DP（`tensor_parallel_size "
"== 1`）解码场景设计的；在 `tensor_parallel_size > 1` 时，标准 TP 维度接管，细粒度配置不生效。 |"

msgid ""
"To evaluate the effectiveness of fine-grained TP in large-scale service "
"scenarios, we use the model **DeepSeek-R1-W8A8**, deploy PD separated decode"
" instances in an environment of 32 cards Ascend Atlas A2 inference "
"products*64G (A2), with parallel configuration as DP32+EP32, and fine-"
"grained TP size of 8; the performance data is as follows."
msgstr ""
"为了评估细粒度 TP 在大规模服务场景中的有效性，我们使用 **DeepSeek-R1-W8A8** 模型，在 32 卡 Ascend Atlas A2"
" 推理产品*64G (A2) 环境中部署 PD 分离的 decode 实例，并行配置为 DP32+EP32，细粒度 TP 大小为 8；性能数据如下。"
